       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID.             TCCCLEAR.
       AUTHOR.                 W. ROXBURY.
       INSTALLATION.           GOODYEAR TIRE & RUBBER.
      *REMARKS.
      *    1. SPARE PARTS DUPLICATION ENTRIES (STARTING WITH '//')
      *       ARE CLEARED FROM THE FILE.
      *
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       CONFIGURATION SECTION.
       SOURCE-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       OBJECT-COMPUTER.        IBM-AS400.
       INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
       FILE-CONTROL.
           SELECT CORP-CODE-LINK
                  ASSIGN       TO DATABASE-MCFLMM2101
                  ORGANIZATION IS INDEXED
                  ACCESS MODE  IS DYNAMIC
                  RECORD KEY   IS EXTERNALLY-DESCRIBED-KEY
                               WITH DUPLICATES
                  FILE STATUS  IS FILE-STAT.

       DATA DIVISION.
       FILE SECTION.
       FD  CORP-CODE-LINK
           LABEL RECORDS ARE STANDARD
           DATA RECORD IS CCLFREC.
       01  CCLFREC.
           COPY DDS-ALL-FORMATS OF MCFLMM2101.

       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  FILE-STAT.
           05 FILE-STAT-1      PIC X   VALUE "0".
           05 FILE-STAT-2      PIC X   VALUE "0".

       01  CORP-CODE-DATA.
           05  CORP-CODE-KEY.
               10  CC-KEY      PIC X(08).
               10  CC-SS       PIC X(04).
               10  CC-FILL     PIC X(02).
           05  CC-LINK.
               10  CC-DUP      PIC X(02).
               10  CC-D-SS     PIC X(04).
               10  CC-DFIL     PIC X(02).

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PROCESS.
           OPEN I-O            CORP-CODE-LINK.
           PERFORM DBGET-LOOP  THRU DL-EXIT.

       END-OF-JOB.
           CLOSE               CORP-CODE-LINK.
           GOBACK.

       DBGET-LOOP.
           READ CORP-CODE-LINK FIRST INTO CORP-CODE-DATA
               AT END          MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT = "10" OR "14" OR "43"
               GO TO DL-EXIT
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "* ERROR * ERROR * ERROR * ERROR *"
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY
               "  SEQUENTIAL READ FAILED ON CORP-CODE-LINK"
               DISPLAY "    FILE-STAT = " FILE-STAT
               DISPLAY "    RUN ABORTED PREMATURELY"
               DISPLAY "    "
               GO TO DL-EXIT.

           GO TO DBGET-COMP.

       DBGET-CONT.
           READ CORP-CODE-LINK NEXT INTO CORP-CODE-DATA
               AT END          MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT = "10" OR "14" OR "43"
               GO TO DL-EXIT
           ELSE
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "* ERROR * ERROR * ERROR * ERROR *"
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY
               "  SEQUENTIAL READ FAILED ON CORP-CODE-LINK"
               DISPLAY "    FILE-STAT = " FILE-STAT
               DISPLAY "    RUN ABORTED PREMATURELY"
               DISPLAY "    "
               GO TO DL-EXIT.

       DBGET-COMP.
           IF CC-DUP = "//"
               PERFORM DELETE-DUPLICATE THRU DD-EXIT.

           GO TO DBGET-CONT.

       DL-EXIT.                EXIT.

       DELETE-DUPLICATE.
           DELETE CORP-CODE-LINK
               INVALID KEY     MOVE FILE-STAT TO FILE-STAT.
           IF FILE-STAT NOT = "00"
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY "* ERROR * ERROR * ERROR * ERROR *"
               DISPLAY "    "
               DISPLAY
               "  DELETE FAILED ON CORP-CODE-LINK"
               DISPLAY "    FILE-STAT = " FILE-STAT
               DISPLAY "    RUN ABORTED PREMATURELY"
               DISPLAY "    "
               GO TO END-OF-JOB.

       DD-EXIT.                EXIT.

      ***************  END OF FILE  **************************************
